From: nuc-bios-build <nbatkins@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] UsbNetwork: assume media on a point-to-point USB gadget

NetworkCommon starts every NIC at CableDetect = 0 and only raises it when it
catches a CDC NETWORK_CONNECTION/NETWORK_CONNECTED notification. Linux's f_ecm
emits those only on link-state changes, and the enumeration-time one fires long
before the UEFI driver binds -- so it is effectively never seen and the first
Redfish request fails with EFI_NO_MEDIA.

That model suits a dongle with an RJ45, where "no cable" is a real state worth
reporting. It does not suit a point-to-point gadget, where enumeration *is* the
proof of link: if the device is on the bus at all, the BMC is on the other end.

So default it to 1, and stop NETWORK_DISCONNECT from clearing it -- a host
reset makes f_ecm queue a disconnect that the freshly bound driver reads on the
next boot, which would otherwise strand the link as unplugged for that whole
boot (the matching CONNECTED having been emitted while nothing was listening).

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [embedded specific]
Signed-off-by: nuc-bios-build <nbatkins@gmail.com>
---
diff --git a/MdeModulePkg/Bus/Usb/UsbNetwork/NetworkCommon/DriverBinding.c b/MdeModulePkg/Bus/Usb/UsbNetwork/NetworkCommon/DriverBinding.c
index a2a5b82776..c297e13471 100644
--- a/MdeModulePkg/Bus/Usb/UsbNetwork/NetworkCommon/DriverBinding.c
+++ b/MdeModulePkg/Bus/Usb/UsbNetwork/NetworkCommon/DriverBinding.c
@@ -289,7 +289,7 @@ NetworkCommonDriverStart (
 
   NicDevice->NicInfo.UsbEth         = UsbEth;
   NicDevice->NicInfo.MaxSegmentSize = (UINT16)BulkDataSize;
-  NicDevice->NicInfo.CableDetect    = 0;
+  NicDevice->NicInfo.CableDetect    = 1;  // NucRedfish: point-to-point ECM gadget, see wire-redfish.py
   NicDevice->ReceiveBuffer          = ALIGN_POINTER ((VOID *)NicDevice, 4096);
 
   CopyMem ((CHAR8 *)&(NicDevice->NicInfo.MacAddr), (CHAR8 *)&MacAddress, sizeof (MacAddress));
diff --git a/MdeModulePkg/Bus/Usb/UsbNetwork/NetworkCommon/PxeFunction.c b/MdeModulePkg/Bus/Usb/UsbNetwork/NetworkCommon/PxeFunction.c
index 049618b6c6..70b6c8942a 100644
--- a/MdeModulePkg/Bus/Usb/UsbNetwork/NetworkCommon/PxeFunction.c
+++ b/MdeModulePkg/Bus/Usb/UsbNetwork/NetworkCommon/PxeFunction.c
@@ -455,7 +455,7 @@ UndiInitialize (
 
   if (Cdb->OpFlags == PXE_OPFLAGS_INITIALIZE_DETECT_CABLE) {
     if ((Nic->Request.Request == USB_CDC_NETWORK_CONNECTION) && (Nic->Request.Value == NETWORK_DISCONNECT)) {
-      Nic->CableDetect = 0;
+      Nic->CableDetect = 1;  // NucRedfish: link is point-to-point
     } else if ((Nic->Request.Request == USB_CDC_NETWORK_CONNECTION) && (Nic->Request.Value == NETWORK_CONNECTED)) {
       Nic->CableDetect = 1;
     }
@@ -1195,7 +1195,7 @@ UndiGetStatus (
   }
 
   if ((Nic->Request.Request == USB_CDC_NETWORK_CONNECTION) && (Nic->Request.Value == NETWORK_DISCONNECT)) {
-    Nic->CableDetect = 0;
+    Nic->CableDetect = 1;  // NucRedfish: link is point-to-point
   } else if ((Nic->Request.Request == USB_CDC_NETWORK_CONNECTION) && (Nic->Request.Value == NETWORK_CONNECTED)) {
     Nic->CableDetect = 1;
   }
